  tanuki-app-icon.svg (assets/app-icon.svg), in its 64-unit space.

  Scaled so the app icon's 79.73-unit tile maps onto the 72dp a launcher mask shows: the mark then fills
  ~60% of the visible icon, as the design system's app icon does, and stays inside the 66dp safe circle.
  Also the splash icon (values/themes.xml), which the platform masks to the same circle.
-->
